There is a knock on the door.
It is Nina, my neighbour.
She asks: "Hi Maya, how are you?"
"It's going well, thank you," I say.
"I have to go to the kommune today."
Nina nods.
"Okay," she says.
"First you need to get a Danish phone number."
She explains.
First: go to a phone shop.
Then: go to the kommune.
"The kommune is not far away," she says.
"You just take bus number four."
Bus number four.
Okay.
Nina is very kind.
